OL,4,CTypical energy bill forecast to go up  
OL,5,Cby #443 a year from January as         
OL,6,Cinflation rate rises again             
OL,7,GGas and electricity bills for a        
OL,8,Gtypical household are forecast to jump 
OL,9,Gby #443 a year from January as the     
OL,10,Ginflation rate rose to its highest     
OL,11,Glevel in a year.                       
OL,13,FA typical annual bill is predicted to  
OL,14,Frise by 26% in the new year, according 
OL,15,Fto consultancy Cornwall Insight, ahead 
OL,16,Fof the official announcement next week.
OL,18,FSome households will get a #100        
OL,19,Fpayment to help with the rising cost   
OL,20,Fof living, a policy which was          
OL,21,Fannounced in the Budget.               
